abstract: >-
  A leakage-controlled, nested-walk-forward pipeline for quarterly UK CO2e
  emissions forecasting comparing macroeconomic/weather/mobility predictors
  against electricity-grid carbon-intensity and generation-mix fusion,
  across four data configurations and five feature-selection strategies,
  with Pareto/VIKOR decision support and TreeSHAP interpretability.
